Files: tools/upstream-selectors.txt
Copyright: 2011-2026 Linux Mint Project (Cinnamon), 2012-2026 Linux Mint (Mint-Y)
License: GPL-2.0+
 Mechanically extracted list of CSS class/id *names* used by Cinnamon's shell
 and by the Mint-Y theme, kept so that tools/check-theme.py can flag selectors
 that Cinnamon does not implement. No style rules or other creative content is
 reproduced. Names and short identifiers are not copyrightable expression; the
 GPL-2.0+ notice is retained for the derivation, and the upstream projects are
 not affiliated with or endorsing this package.

